37910	56	34799561	curated	[2026-10-07 Claude] CURATED: 307 descriptions; publication to review: 14 viral peptides cross a cleavage site.\n- Remark: 14 descriptions had a 16-residue viral peptide that is exact on the polyprotein but crosses the cleavage site between two mature proteins, so it fits neither. These peptides are removed from the mappings and recorded here (the other mappings are kept); a review of the publication should decide where they belong. Peptide positions are on the polyprotein; interactor positions are the mature protein's coordinates on it.\n- Remark: nsp8/nsp9 site, ASSAVTLQNNEIRPSG (4211-4226): EY27E3AE75 (USP7, P0C6T5 nsp9 4219-4328), EY5C39F912 (USP7, P0C6W4 nsp9 4219-4328).\n- Remark: nsp9/nsp10 site, QAGSNTEFAINSSVLS (4328-4343): EYAE523C46 (USP7, P0C6T5 nsp10 4329-4467), EY54EDFA88 (USP7, P0C6W4 nsp10 4329-4467).\n- Remark: nsp4/nsp5 site, TPPTVSYGSTLQAGLR (2954-2969): EY026760DC (USP7, P0C6U2 nsp4 2485-2965), EYB334C0AE (USP7, P0C6X1 nsp4 2485-2965).\n- Remark: nsp4/nsp5 site, QPPQTSITSAVLQSGF: EYBEE079A7 (USP7, P0C6U8 nsp4 2741-3240; 3228-3243), EYB4C087EE (USP7, P0C6X7 nsp4 2741-3240; 3228-3243), EYB8F6585D (USP7, P0C6W6 nsp4 2739-3238; 3226-3241), EYF74CEBA3 (USP7, P0DTC1 nsp4 2764-3263; 3251-3266), EYBDA89EB1 (USP7, P0DTD1 nsp4 2764-3263; 3251-3266).\n- Remark: nsp13/nsp14 site, FFEIKHADLHSSQVCG (5558-5573): EY640D2918 (MSN), EY8683F8BE (RDX), EYE107E2BA (EZR), all P0C6X5 nsp13 4971-5567.\n--- Curator note (before Claude) ---\nDone. Pierre to upload	2026-10-07 12:06:11	\N
